        {
          "es": "En la puerta del inframundo espera un perro de tres cabezas.",
          "en": "At the gate of the Underworld waits a dog with three heads."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se llama Cerbero, y su cola es una serpiente viva.",
          "en": "His name is Cerberus, and his tail is a living snake."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando llega un alma nueva, mueve la cola. Muy amistoso.",
          "en": "When a new soul arrives, he wags that tail. So friendly."
